    {
      "id": "2122075990784671810",
      "text": "C.J. Stroud's pass is incomplete, and Texans turn the ball over on downs. What an impressive defensive stand to close out this game and win 27-24. What a comeback, with the 6th fourth-quarter go-ahead drive. #Browns enter the bye week 6-4, and are undefeated at home.",
